    "name": "Trickshotterz",
    "steam_appid": 3619490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Imagine if Beer Pong grew legs, picked up powerups and abilities, and battled across chaotic maps built for wild trickshots.</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Score in the Top, or Not at All</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/93172e2834075dd6b1eabc07d58f3487.poster.avif?t=1755482227\" aria-label=\"Score in the top of your friends&#039; cup\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/93172e2834075dd6b1eabc07d58f3487.webm?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/93172e2834075dd6b1eabc07d58f3487.mp4?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 players, locally or online. Score by landing your shot in the <strong>top</strong> of an opponent\u2019s cup <i>\u2014</i> or knock them off instead. Pull off <strong>bounce plays</strong>, <strong>wild ricochets</strong>, and <strong>satisfying trickshots</strong> to eliminate your friends and win the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powerups That Flip the Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/9ef94cbeeb4773d82dac4890ab2b9b05.poster.avif?t=1755482227\" aria-label=\"Use chaotic powerups to take out others\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/9ef94cbeeb4773d82dac4890ab2b9b05.webm?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/9ef94cbeeb4773d82dac4890ab2b9b05.mp4?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use wild powerups that spawn mid-match to flip the fight. Launch an <strong>RPG</strong> that bursts into mini balls, steer a <strong>remote-control ball</strong>, drop a <strong>shockwave</strong>,<i>\u00a0</i>or unleash a <strong>mini black hole</strong> that sucks everyone in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Pick A Playstyle Defining Ability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/8656398cf8e8c6cb65cc994135b89b9f.poster.avif?t=1755482227\" aria-label=\"Pick and use various abilities to change your playstyle (wind blast shown here)\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/8656398cf8e8c6cb65cc994135b89b9f.webm?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/8656398cf8e8c6cb65cc994135b89b9f.mp4?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each set of rounds, pick one ability to shape your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Wind Blast</strong> (parry incoming attacks - shown here), <strong>Dash</strong> (dodge danger by inches), <strong>Undying</strong> (haunt and control your friends), and more\u00a0<i>\u2014</i> each one reshapes how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shoot From the Grave</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/c05d7998f4230f74f5b90ba3923a70dc.poster.avif?t=1755482227\" aria-label=\"Even after death you can still shoot and score, but you only have one shot\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/c05d7998f4230f74f5b90ba3923a70dc.webm?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/c05d7998f4230f74f5b90ba3923a70dc.mp4?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re holding a ball or powerup when <strong>eliminated</strong>, you get one final shot before hitting the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clutch it or waste it\u00a0<i>\u2014</i> it could be the difference between a draw and total defeat.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Imagine if Beer Pong grew legs, picked up powerups and abilities, and battled across chaotic maps built for wild trickshots.</i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Score in the Top, or Not at All</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/93172e2834075dd6b1eabc07d58f3487.poster.avif?t=1755482227\" aria-label=\"Score in the top of your friends&#039; cup\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/93172e2834075dd6b1eabc07d58f3487.webm?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/93172e2834075dd6b1eabc07d58f3487.mp4?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 players, locally or online. Score by landing your shot in the <strong>top</strong> of an opponent\u2019s cup <i>\u2014</i> or knock them off instead. Pull off <strong>bounce plays</strong>, <strong>wild ricochets</strong>, and <strong>satisfying trickshots</strong> to eliminate your friends and win the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powerups That Flip the Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/9ef94cbeeb4773d82dac4890ab2b9b05.poster.avif?t=1755482227\" aria-label=\"Use chaotic powerups to take out others\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/9ef94cbeeb4773d82dac4890ab2b9b05.webm?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/9ef94cbeeb4773d82dac4890ab2b9b05.mp4?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use wild powerups that spawn mid-match to flip the fight. Launch an <strong>RPG</strong> that bursts into mini balls, steer a <strong>remote-control ball</strong>, drop a <strong>shockwave</strong>,<i>\u00a0</i>or unleash a <strong>mini black hole</strong> that sucks everyone in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Pick A Playstyle Defining Ability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/8656398cf8e8c6cb65cc994135b89b9f.poster.avif?t=1755482227\" aria-label=\"Pick and use various abilities to change your playstyle (wind blast shown here)\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/8656398cf8e8c6cb65cc994135b89b9f.webm?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/8656398cf8e8c6cb65cc994135b89b9f.mp4?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each set of rounds, pick one ability to shape your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Wind Blast</strong> (parry incoming attacks - shown here), <strong>Dash</strong> (dodge danger by inches), <strong>Undying</strong> (haunt and control your friends), and more\u00a0<i>\u2014</i> each one reshapes how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shoot From the Grave</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/c05d7998f4230f74f5b90ba3923a70dc.poster.avif?t=1755482227\" aria-label=\"Even after death you can still shoot and score, but you only have one shot\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/c05d7998f4230f74f5b90ba3923a70dc.webm?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/c05d7998f4230f74f5b90ba3923a70dc.mp4?t=1755482227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re holding a ball or powerup when <strong>eliminated</strong>, you get one final shot before hitting the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clutch it or waste it\u00a0<i>\u2014</i> it could be the difference between a draw and total defeat.</p>",
    "short_description": "Sink your ball into your friend's cups before they get you first. Pick an ability, grab wild powerups, and pull off absurd trickshots in tons of physics-based maps built for insane plays. Play up to 4 players local, online, or hop into public matchmaking.",
